Phaedra packaging notes
=======================

Do not distribute a Phaedra installer until the executable, audio engine,
plugins, bundled libraries and updater have passed tests on a clean machine.
Preserve GPL source-distribution requirements and third-party copyright
notices, including those for the inherited engine components.

The build currently uses some legacy library/data directories and session
extensions for compatibility. Do not rename those paths without updating the
resolution code and testing existing projects.

See COPYING, README and .github/workflows/build-release.yml.
